tps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1329080/extras/075c260775cff2063cf55c8f9063c9a8.webp?t=1716452957\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1329080/extras/4506f5925c559e53cd0d31b8fcd1f3f3.poster.avif?t=1716452957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1329080/extras/4506f5925c559e53cd0d31b8fcd1f3f3.webm?t=1716452957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Progress zips along, as well as the inventiveness of your enemy that may drive you green with envy.<br>Expect a continuous hailstorm of different high-tech metals with a dose of lethal nuclear explosives.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1329080/extras/e13ddc10ca845e0da6c421e5ae2190eb.webp?t=1716452957\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1329080/extras/745495eb5e70c81e29158ea91a8645ee.avif?t=1716452957\" /></div><br><br>Distill a vital potion by yourself! The only thing that can stop a bear is a bottle of vodka! Save a few bottles for you and your brand new Siberian friend.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1329080/extras/d9f83ca335ee6bb3c586e757225fb455.webp?t=1716452957\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1329080/extras/61f4104e21a5c739305851fc9d168be2.poster.avif?t=1716452957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1329080/extras/61f4104e21a5c739305851fc9d168be2.webm?t=1716452957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>This will make your enemy respect you at least, or at most will make him silent forever. A marvel of engineering and a combination of infernal power and splendor \u2013 &quot;STEPAN&quot; the intercontinental ballistic missile.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1329080/extras/1cdf2a2e76fcdb4aa43ac6d8a55bf266.webp?t=1716452957\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1329080/extras/b240a8c4d359c5599be62f29b176b4fa.avif?t=1716452957\" /></div><br><br>A certain track has tired you while playing? Or maybe you have a favourite one already? Specially for music lovers, we have prepared an in-game audio-player for you. Handy, practical and unobtrusive!",
